### Catálogo de roles para una persona nueva (200; Jobs primero, nunca Super Administrador)
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/getAssignableRoles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Roles para una persona visible: isActive marca su rol actual (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/getAssignableRoles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 3096
}

### Persona no visible → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/getAssignableRoles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 1
}
